      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ALLWOODS CHEVRON (11) finished fourth last start over 2190m at Northam, beaten 10 metres, after a good win at Northam the run prior. Gets a soft run on the inside of the second line but may need luck at some point. Meets a comparable field and he is capable of a much better performance. SONIC SEELSTER (3) was in the money two runs ago then went well again last time over 1609m at Bunbury, finishing 2.75 metres from the winner in third. Has the benefit of a good draw. Good enough to take out a race like this. SPINNER OF YARNS (9) should be ready to peak now after finishing third over 1780m at Northam a week-and-a-half ago. Expect him to give this a real shake. OURFIRSTIMPRESSION (7) showed pleasing improvement last time out when third over 1140m at Bunbury.",
